# =============================================================================
# ddr3_pins_s0.fdc - DDR3 pin locations for the S0 build only
#
# S0 does not instantiate the DDR3 IP; the top ties the DDR3 pins to safe
# values.  These attributes keep the 71 DDR3 balls + ref_clk on the correct
# package pins.  IP generated clocks / PHY placement are intentionally omitted;
# use ip/ddr3/ddr3_ip.fdc with the real IP in S2/BIST.
#
# Generated from 5-stage-baseline/fpga/pango/ip/ddr3/ddr3_ip.fdc
# Target: PG2L200H-6IFBB676
# =============================================================================

